<title>FRANCE: Soccer-French league summaries.</title>
<headline>Soccer-French league summaries.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of French first division</p>
<p>matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Auxerre 2 (Bernard Diomede 47th, Emmanuel Petit own goal 65th)</p>
<p>Monaco 0. Halftime 0-0. Attendance: 15,000.</p>
<p>Bastia 0 Nantes 0. 0-0. 8,000.</p>
<p>Bordeaux 1 (Kaba Diawara 68th) Strasbourg 2 (Jan Suchoparek</p>
<p>86th, Gerald Baticle 90th penalty). 0-0. 10,000.</p>
<p>Metz 0 Cannes 0. 0-0. 9,000.</p>
<p>Marseille 2 (Xavier Gravelaine 42nd, Olivier Echouafni 73rd)</p>
<p>Guingamp 1 (Stephane Carnot 51st). 1-0. 15,000.</p>
<p>Lille 1 (Djezon Boutoille 7th) Caen 0. 1-0. 7,000.</p>
<p>Lyon 1 (Franck Gava 57th) Paris Saint-Germain 1 (Julio Cesar</p>
<p>Dely Valdes 67th). 0-0. 30,000.</p>
<p>Rennes 2 (Stephane Guivarc'h 16th, Laurent Huard 75th)</p>
<p>Montpellier 0. 1-0. 10,000.</p>
<p>Nice 1 (Roberto Onorati 40th) Nancy 0. 1-0. 3,000.</p>
<p>Played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Le Havre 0 Lens 0. 8,000.</p>
